    "## Task 2: Text Preprocessing\n",
    "\n",
    "Clean the raw text data before feeding it to any model. Raw text has noise — punctuation, numbers, stopwords — that adds no meaning. We remove all of it.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Steps:**\n",
    "1. **Lowercasing** — Convert \"Hello\" and \"hello\" to the same token\n",
    "2. **Remove special characters** — Remove punctuation, numbers, symbols  \n",
    "3. **Tokenization** — Split sentence into individual words\n",
    "4. **Remove stopwords** — Remove words like \"the\", \"is\", \"a\" that carry no sentiment meaning\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "92bdbfff",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "PREPROCESSING RESULTS — Before vs After:\n",
      "=================================================================\n",
      "\n",
