      "  BEFORE: I need information about the payment process. My ticket number is 78732. Please respond as soon as possible.\n",
      "  AFTER : information payment process ticket number respond soon possible\n",
      "\n",
      "Example 2:\n",
      "  BEFORE: I need information about the payment process.\n",
      "  AFTER : information payment process\n",
      "\n",
